UPDATE companies SET description='Lang''s Old Car Parts, Inc. operates from Baldwinville, Massachusetts, where it was founded more than 35 years ago as a family-owned business built around a passion for the Model T Ford. The company began with family members selling used parts at swap meets before expanding into a dedicated catalog and online operation.

The firm specializes in supplying new, used, and new-old-stock (NOS) parts for the Model T, along with accessories, books, and instructional videos. Its catalog covers hundreds of categories — from engine and transmission components to body, upholstery, and electrical items — and also includes parts for Fordson tractors.

The staff, three-quarters of whom own a Model T themselves, provide free technical support to help buyers identify the correct components for their projects.

