UPDATE companies SET description='Largo Tank & Equipment Inc. operates from Farmington, New Mexico, where it has served the Southwest for over 25 years. No founders or ownership details are disclosed.

At its Farmington facility, Largo designs, welds, and assembles custom truck bodies, cargo tanks, and fire equipment. The shop produces flatbeds, welder bodies, platform and dump bodies, service bodies, oilfield and chemical treater trucks, crane bodies, contractor beds, propane service trucks, and van bodies.

The company serves oil and gas, propane, construction, fuel delivery, mining, crane service, delivery, fire and emergency, government, farm and ranch, plumbing, and landscaping sectors. Customers include municipal fleets, public works departments, wildland firefighting units, and commercial contractors operating in the San Juan Basin and surrounding regions.

