UPDATE companies SET description='Lawrence Foods, Inc. has operated from Elk Grove Village, Illinois since its founding in 1890 by Major Lawrence. The company remains family-owned, tracing its roots to the establishment of Ad. Seidel & Son, Inc. and Hilker & Bletsch in Chicago before Lawrence Foods expanded.

As a broadline manufacturer of premium bakery ingredients, the company produces icings, fruit fillings, crème fillings, dry mixes, fondant, glazes, fruit preparations, jellies and preserves, nutrition bar components, and savory spreads. Production takes place in a 293,000-square-foot facility that houses formulation, packaging, and a working baking environment used for product testing and development.

Lawrence Foods serves retail bakery operations of all sizes, commercial food manufacturers, in-store supermarket bakeries, foodservice operators, and distributors across the United States. Its customer base spans the baking industry from large-scale industrial producers to small independent shops.

The company differentiates itself by not owning orchards or agricultural processing plants, allowing it to source fruit from the freshest seasonal regions. A dedicated technical team including a chief chemist, food technologists, and master bakers works alongside clients to develop ingredient solutions, supported by SQF Level 3 certification held for the past five years.', certifications=ARRAY['SQF Level 3']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Bakery ingredient manufacturing", "Formulation development", "Packaging", "Product testing and development (baking lab)", "Fruit sourcing and processing", "Custom ingredient solutions"], "industries": ["Baking industry", "Commercial food manufacturing", "In-store supermarket bakeries", "Foodservice operators", "Distributors", "Retail bakery operations"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Sources fruit from peak-season regions rather than owning orchards", "On-site baking laboratory for real-world product testing and client collaboration", "Technical staff includes chief chemist, food technologists, and master bakers", "SQF Level 3 certification maintained for five consecutive years", "Fourth-generation family ownership with continuous operation since 1890"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1890 by Major Lawrence -> /about", "Family-owned since 1890 -> /about", "Headquarters Elk Grove Village, Illinois -> /about", "293,000 sq ft facility -> /about", "Products: icings, fruit fillings, cr\u00e8me fillings, dry mixes, fondant, glazes, fruit preparations, jellies, preserves, nutrition bar components, savory spreads -> /", "Serves retail bakeries, commercial manufacturers, supermarket bakeries, foodservice operators, distributors -> /", "Does not own orchards; buys fruit in season -> /about", "Working baking environment as part of testing laboratory -> /about", "Technical staff: chief chemist, food technologists, master bakers -> /about", "SQF Level 3 certification for five yea