UPDATE companies SET description='Lehi Sheet Metal Corporation was founded in September 1978 in Ashland, Massachusetts, and relocated to Westborough in 1980. The company became a legacy family-owned business in 2018 when longtime general manager Darren Bullen, son of the previous owner, acquired it. In January 2020, Lori Bullen joined as CEO, bringing 27 years of experience from the U.S. Postal Service and Lean Six Sigma Green Belt certification.

The 50,000-square-foot Westborough facility houses a full-service precision sheet metal shop, an in-house paint, powder coat, and silkscreen operation (Galaxy Coatings, acquired in 2007), and a CNC machine shop (East Coast Machining Solutions, added in 2025). Core processes include laser cutting, forming, press brake forming, welding, machining, hardware insertion, riveting, powder coating, silk screening, and wet paint. The company focuses on prototype and low-volume production runs.

Lehi serves industries including robotics, medical devices, automotive, electronics, telecommunications, oil and gas, energy systems, water systems, start-ups, marine, agricultural, instrumentation, solar systems, and aerospace.

The company emphasizes a “one-stop-shop” model with all fabrication, finishing, and machining under one roof, supported by in-house tooling lists for turret punch presses that help reduce design costs. Lehi cites a greater-than-99% quality rate, an average employee tenure of 16 years, and adherence to ISO 9001:2015, ITAR, and AS9100 standards as key differentiators.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','AS9100','ITAR']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Laser cutting", "Forming", "Press brake forming", "Welding", "CNC machining", "Hardware insertion", "Sheet metal assembly", "Riveting", "Powder coating", "Silk screening", "Wet paint", "Prototype sheet metal fabrication", "Low-volume sheet metal production"], "industries": ["Robotics", "Medical device", "Automotive", "Electronics", "Telecommunications", "Oil & gas", "Energy systems", "Water systems", "Start-ups", "Marine", "Agricultural", "Instrumentation", "Solar systems", "Aerospace"], "materials": ["Aluminum 5052-H32", "Stainless steel", "Cold rolled steel"], "equipment": ["turret punch presses"], "volume": "Prototype to low-volume production", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["All fabrication, finishing, and machining under one roof", "In-house turret punch press tooling lists to reduce design costs", "Average employee tenure of 16 years", "Greater than 99% quality rate", "ITAR registered, ISO 9001:2015 certified, AS9100 compliant"], "facts_used": ["Founded September 1978 in Ashland, MA -> /about-us", "Moved to Westborough, MA in 1980 -> /about-us", "Expanded to 50,000 sq ft facility in 2001 -> /about-us", "Acquired Galaxy Coatings in 2007 for in-house paint/powder coat/silkscreen -> /about-us", "Added East Coast Machining Solutions machine shop in 2025 -> /about-us", "Legacy family-owned since 2018 sale to Darren Bullen -> /about-us", "Lori Bullen appointed CEO in January 2020 -> /about-us", "Average employee tenure 16 years -> /about-us", "ISO 9001:2015 certified, ITAR registered, AS9100 compliant -> /, /about-us", "Processes: laser cutting, forming, press brake forming, welding, machining, hardware insertion, assemblies, riveting, powder coating, silk screening, wet paint -> /", "Materials: aluminum 5052-H32, stainless steels, cold rolled steel -> /services", "Industries served: robotics, medical device, automotive, electronics, telecommunications, oil & gas, energy systems, water systems, start-ups, marine, agricultural, instrumentation, solar systems, aerospace -> /services", "Prototype and low-volume production focus -> /services, /", "In-house tooling lists for turret punch presses -> /", "Greater than 99% quality rate -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "LEHI Sheet Metal delivers precision sheet metal fabrication, on site CNC machining and on site industrial paint/powder coat and silkscreen", "founded_year": "1978", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": ["ITAR registered"], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='lehi-sheet-metal-corp' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
