UPDATE companies SET description='Logix, LLC, founded in 2015 and based in Belfast, Maine, began as SolarLogix, a small family-run solar and heat pump installation company started by Josh and Rachele. The business rebranded to Logix as its service lines expanded to meet growing demand for electrification.

