UPDATE companies SET description='Long Leaf Wood Shop operates in Montgomery, Alabama, where it was founded in 2019. The business grew from a decades-long passion for woodworking; its founders had accumulated over 35 years of experience before opening the shop. Initially launched as a member-based woodworking space that also produced custom furniture and hosted classes, the company shifted focus within a few years to dedicate itself primarily to custom furniture production.

The shop produces custom-built furniture, blending traditional joinery with contemporary design. A team of several craftsmen contributes over 240 years of combined experience to each project. Beyond furniture, the facility runs woodworking classes, date-night sessions, and corporate team-building events, using its workshop as a venue for hands-on experiences.

Clients include interior designers who rely on the shop to execute precise, vision-driven pieces, and homeowners seeking one-of-a-kind furnishings. Corporate groups also book the space for structured team-building activities, making the shop a hybrid production and event venue.

The company emphasizes that every piece tells a story, aiming to merge timeless craftsmanship with modern and traditional aesthetics. This narrative-driven approach, rooted in the founders'' original dream of a creative community space, remains the stated reason for the business’s existence.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom furniture manufacturing", "Woodworking", "Woodworking classes", "Team building events", "Corporate events", "Date night events"], "industries": ["Furniture", "Interior design", "Corporate events", "Team building"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Over 240 years of combined craftsmanship experience", "Blend of timeless techniques with modern and traditional design", "Custom furniture built to client specifications", "Woodworking classes and corporate team-building events offered on-site"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2019 -> /about", "Located in Montgomery, Alabama -> db", "Started as member-based wood shop -> /about", "Shifted to primarily custom furniture -> /about", "Several craftsmen with over 240 years combined experience -> /about", "Offers custom furniture, classes, team building, corporate events -> /", "Serves designers and homeowners -> /", "Blends timeless techniques with modern and traditional design -> /about"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "primarily dedicated to building beautiful pieces of furniture", "founded_year": "2019", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='long-leaf-wood-shop' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Loose Plastics Inc. was founded in 1985 by Scott C. Loose in Gladwin, Michigan. Loose, drawing on his background in the plastic sheet industry, started the company in a 3,200-square-foot facility as a one-person operation cleaning and grinding automotive dunnage trays.

The company specializes in custom sheet extrusion and coextrusion, operating ten extrusion lines with AB-ABA coextrusion capabilities from a 120,000-square-foot plant. The facility runs 24/7 on four shifts and employs over 120 people. Since adding its first extruder in late 1985, Loose Plastics has expanded steadily, adding computerized extrusion in 1993 and coextrusion technology in 2010.

Loose Plastics serves industrial customers requiring custom plastic sheet, with roots in automotive dunnage tray production. The company’s early work centered on automotive components, and it has since grown to supply a broader base of manufacturers seeking extruded sheet products.

