UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 1988, Los Angeles Lighting Mfg. Co. operates from its corporate headquarters in El Monte, California, just east of Los Angeles.

The company designs and builds LED luminaires and retrofit products for a range of applications, offering standard product lines, modified fixtures, and fully custom solutions. Its California facility houses in-house engineering and a flexible manufacturing line capable of adjusting dimensions, lumen output, color temperature (80 or 90 CRI), and integrating wireless or wired controls. The operation supports both small and large production runs with custom packaging and assembly options.

The firm also develops signature products for national accounts and supplies retrofit kits for existing installations.

The company emphasizes its "Made in America" status and compliance with Buy American Act (BAA) and Build America, Buy America (BABA) requirements. Its stated mission is to deliver exactly what the customer wants, when they want it, backed by direct communication between sales, engineering, and the shop floor.', certifications=ARRAY['BAA Compliant','BABA Compliant']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Design and manufacture of commercial, industrial, institutional, and custom LED luminaires", "Retrofit solutions", "Modified dimensions for installation constraints", "Customizable lumen output", "Wide range of color temperatures", "80 or 90 CRI options", "Wireless and wired controls integration", "Flexible manufacturing and shipping schedules", "Custom packaging and assembly", "Signature product development for national accounts"], "industries": ["Commercial offices", "Education (schools)", "Parking structures/garages", "Warehouses", "Cleanrooms", "Manufacturing facilities", "Medical/healthcare facilities", "National accounts (government/large enterprise)"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Made in America, fully BAA and BABA compliant", "In-house engineering team", "Flexible, state-of-the-art manufacturing facility", "Dependable manufacturing lead times", "Custom packaging and assembly"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1988 -> /about", "Headquarters in El Monte, California -> /about", "BAA and BABA compliant -> /", "Made in America claim -> /", "In-house engineering team -> /about", "Flexible manufacturing facility -> /about", "Custom luminaires and retrofit solutions -> /about", "Industries served: offices, schools, garages, warehouses, cleanrooms, manufacturing, medical facilities -> /", "Capabilities list including modified dimensions, customizable lumen output, color temperatures, CRI, controls, packaging -> /about"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "L.A. Lightin