UPDATE companies SET description='M&Q Packaging LLC, based in Schuylkill Haven, Pennsylvania, was founded in 1976. The company has spent over five decades developing high-temperature nylon packaging for demanding industrial applications.

The company manufactures custom plastic packaging solutions, including vacuum bagging films for composite manufacturing, sterilization packaging for medical devices, solvent recovery bags for chemical resistance, cleanroom and anti-static packaging for electronics, modified atmosphere packaging for food processing, and custom-engineered nylon, polyester, and elastomer films. Its products are designed to withstand temperatures up to 400°F, autoclaving, abrasion, and chemical exposure.

M&Q serves aerospace and defense, medical and dental device manufacturing, electronics and cleanroom manufacturing, ballistic glass manufacturing, solvent recovery, and food processing industries. Specific applications include composite layup vacuum bagging, medical instrument sterilization, and food shelf-life extension.

