UPDATE companies SET description='MFG Supply is based in Medford, Wisconsin, and traces its roots to 1963 when Manufacturer''s Supply began as a family-owned mail-order catalog selling small engine parts at fair prices. The business remains in the hands of the founding family, now in its third generation.

The company operates as a distributor of replacement parts for powersports and outdoor power equipment. Its inventory exceeds 21,000 part numbers, covering snowmobiles, ATVs, go-karts, motorcycles, personal watercraft, lawnmowers, chainsaws, snowblowers, and trimmers. Tens of thousands of items are stocked in a warehouse that enables worldwide shipping, with the e-commerce site launching in 1996.

The catalog spans categories such as clutches, electrical components, suspension parts, drive sprockets, and carburetor kits.

