UPDATE companies SET description='MOONEYES Hawaii operates from Honolulu, Hawaii, where it has served as an authorized dealer for the MOONEYES brand since 2007. The business began under the name Pacific Rod and Street, initially as an online store supplying authentic MOONEYES apparel, accessories, and automotive products to hot rod enthusiasts in Hawaii and beyond.

The company retails a full line of MOONEYES merchandise, including exclusive Hawaii-designed apparel, decals, diecast models, aluminum fuel tanks, MOON disc wheel covers, and various speed parts. The Kaimuki location features checkered floors and a hot rod garage atmosphere, while the online store operates 24/7.

Customers include hot rod and custom car builders, collectors, and automotive culture fans both locally and worldwide. The shop has become a gathering point for Hawaii''s hot rod community, and its exclusive Honolulu-themed designs have proven popular among visitors and enthusiasts alike.

