UPDATE companies SET description='MPC Design Technologies, Inc. operates from Albuquerque, New Mexico. The company was founded by a seasoned designer who, after being passed over for a promotion in 1990, decided to start his own business. Since inception, the firm has expanded its team across all departments to deliver the quality products and customer service required in the electronics industry.

The company provides end-to-end custom circuit board production solutions, including schematic capture, PCB design and layout, quick-turn prototyping, fabrication management through stateside partners, full turn-key assembly (both manual and automated), cable and harness assembly, electro-mechanical enclosure integration, and comprehensive supply chain management with full or partial turn-key procurement. MPC imposes no minimum or maximum quantity on fabricated boards, supporting both rapid prototyping and high-volume production runs.

MPC serves customers in commercial automatic test equipment (ATE), industrial electronics, and military high-reliability Class 3 applications. Its design team has experience across ATE, industrial, and military high-reliability Class 3 boards, and the firm’s ITAR registration and vetted American supply chain make it a partner for defense-related programs.

MPC differentiates itself as the only circuit board design-to-production firm in the greater Southwest, offering a firm fixed price for all services and emphasizing time and cost efficiency. The founder’s original motivation—to control his own destiny after a denied promotion—still underpins a culture of flexibility and capability to meet unique project needs.', certifications=ARRAY['ITAR','ISO 9001','IPC-A-610 Class I/II/III','J-STD-001 Class I/II/III','Pro-STD-001','NIST 800-171']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Schematic capture", "PCB design and layout", "Quick-turn prototyping", "PWB fabrication management", "Electro-mechanical assembly", "Full turn-key PCB assembly", "Manual and automated assembly", "Cable, wire and harness assembly", "Electro-mechanical enclosure integration", "Supply chain management", "Full turn-key parts procurement", "Consignment inventory management", "Materials management", "BOM audit", "Counterfeit component detection", "Kit verification"], "industries": ["Commercial ATE", "Industrial", "Military High Reliability"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "Prototype to high volume (no minimum or maximum PWB quantity)", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Only circuit board design-to-production firm in the greater Southwest", "No minimum or maximum PWB fabrication quantity", "ITAR-registered with fully vetted American suppliers", "ISO 9001 certified and IPC-A-610/J-STD-001 compliant assembly", "Firm fixed pricing on all services"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Albuquerque, New Mexico -> /", "Founder started company after being passed over for promotion in 1990 -> /about-us", "Offers custom circuit board production solutions including design, PCB layout, fabrication management, assembly, procurement -> /", "No minimum or maximum PWB fabrication quantity -> /services", "ITAR registered, ISO-9001 certified, IPC member -> /about-us", "Complies with IPC-A-610 Class I, II, III and J-STD-001 Class I, II, III -> /about-