UPDATE companies SET description='MTC Kitchen operates from New York, New York, tracing its origins to 1926.

The business distributes a curated selection of Japanese-made products for professional kitchens. Its catalog spans handcrafted knives and sharpening stones, Hasegawa cutting boards and scrapers, stainless-steel mise en place pans, konro grills made from diatomaceous earth, and consumables such as binchotan and ogatan charcoal, premium rice, artisanal soy sauce, and dashi packs. It also stocks recyclable PET takeout containers in case quantities.

