UPDATE companies SET description='Madison Medical, a Breg Company, operates from Albuquerque, New Mexico. The business was established in 2001 as part of Breg, Inc., which traces its roots to 1989 when it started as a sports medicine company focused on high-quality bracing and cold therapy in Carlsbad, California.

The company designs and manufactures orthopedic bracing and cold therapy devices, and provides consulting, technology, and durable medical equipment (DME) program management. Its portfolio includes more than 320 product styles and sizes. With approximately 1,500 employees across the United States and Mexico, Madison Medical supports a global distribution network reaching 59 countries.

Madison Medical serves the orthopedic care, sports medicine, and durable medical equipment sectors. Its customer base includes more than 9,700 clinics, 38,000 orthopedic providers, and 300-plus integrated delivery networks, collectively serving almost two million patients each year.

The company emphasizes a total-solutions approach that integrates bracing, cold therapy, consulting, and technology to improve patient outcomes and lower the cost of care. It cites a culture of quality, performance, and collaboration, along with sustainability initiatives such as plastic reduction in packaging, energy efficiency investments, and participation in the EPA SmartWay® program for logistics.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Orthopedic bracing manufacturing", "Cold therapy device manufacturing", "DME program management", "Clinical consulting", "Healthcare technology solutions", "Quality management systems", "Digital billing and administration", "Sustainable packaging and logistics optimization"], "industries": ["Orthopedic care", "Sports medicine", "Durable medical equipment", "Healthcare"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Over 320 orthopedic product styles and sizes", "Integrated bracing, cold therapy, consulting, and technology platform", "Serves 9,700+ clinics and 38,000+ providers", "Global distribution to 59 countries", "Sustainability programs including plastic reduction and SmartWay logistics"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2001 -> db", "Headquartered in Albuquerque, New Mexico -> db", "Breg founded in 1989 as sports medicine company -> /about-us", "Approximately 1,500 employees across U.S. and Mexico -> /about-us", "Over 320 product styles and sizes -> /", "Serves 9,700+ clinics, 38,000+ providers, 300+ IDNs -> /about-us", "Nearly two million patients annually -> /about-us", "Global distribution to 59 countries -> /about-us", "Integrates bracing, cold therapy, consulting, technology -> /about-us", "Sustainability initiatives: plastic reduction, pack-size optimization, EPA SmartWay -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Breg began as a sports medicine company focused on high-quality bracing and cold therapy.", "founded_year": "2001", "employee_count": "1,500", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='madison-medical-a-breg-company' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Magna Powertrain is the powertrain operating unit of Magna International, headquartered in Troy, Michigan. The group is led by President Diba Ilunga and serves as a long-standing supplier to the global automotive industry.

The unit provides end-to-end powertrain solutions encompassing design, development, testing, and manufacturing. Its portfolio spans battery-electric (BEV) powertrains, hybrid systems (including 48V mild hybrid, HEV, and PHEV), and a range of modules and components such as transmissions, all-wheel-drive and four-wheel-drive systems, disconnect systems, and common internal-combustion-engine modules. Magna Powertrain also operates a strategic joint venture with LG Electronics, LG Magna, focused on e-mobility components.

Customers are global automotive OEMs producing passenger cars and light commercial vehicles. The group’s hardware and software innovations target CO2 reduction, efficiency, safety, comfort, and driving dynamics across ICE, hybrid, and BEV platforms.

Magna Powertrain emphasizes sustainability across its value chain, reporting 100 percent renewable electricity at all European EMAS-registered sites, a 97 percent recyclability rate for its transmissions, and net-zero roadmaps finalized across its EMAS sites. The joint venture with LG Electronics aims to accelerate growth in the rapidly changing EV component market.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO9001','ISO14001','IATF16949']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Powertrain design", "Powertrain development", "Powertrain testing", "Powertrain manufacturing", "BEV powertrain systems", "Hybrid powertrain systems (48V mild hybrid, HEV, PHEV)", "Powertrain modules and components (transmissions, AWD/4WD, disconnect systems, ICE modules)", "Software integration for powertrain"], "industries": ["Automotive", "Passenger cars", "Light commercial vehicles"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Strategic joint venture with LG Electronics (LG Magna) for e-mobility", "Full in-house capabilities: design, development, testing, manufacturing of powertrain systems", "One of the world\u2019s largest suppliers of powertrain solutions for passenger cars and light commercial vehicles", "100% renewable electricity at all European EMAS sites", "97% recyclability of transmissions"], "facts_used": ["Operating unit of Magna International -> /", "Headquarters in Troy, MI -> /", "President Diba Ilunga -> /", "Strategic joint venture with LG Electronics (LG Magna) -> /", "One of world''s largest suppliers of powertrain solutions for passenger cars and light commercial vehicles -> /", "Capabilities: design, development, testing, manufacturing -> /", "Products: BEV, Hybrid, Modules and Components -> /", "Sustainability: 100% green electricity at EMAS sites, 97% recyclability, net-zero roadmaps -> /", "Certifications: ISO9001, ISO14001, IATF16949 -> db"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Magna\u2019s powertrain group is an operating unit of Magna International and a long-term premier supplier for the global automotive industry with full capabilities in game-changing powertrain design, development, testing and manufacturing.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='magna-powertrain' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
